  "answer": "**答案:约 110.5 米**(全长)。\n\n各来源的数据略有出入:\n- Wikipedia 和 Navypedia:全长 110.5 米。Navypedia 另给出垂线间长 102.2 米。\n- korabley.net:约 111 米。\n- Seaforces:115.5 米,和其他来源差距最大。\n\n我采用 110.5 米,因为两个来源给出了这个数。我只看了搜索结果摘要,没有打开原网页核对。\n\nSources:\n- [TCG Yavuz (F 240) – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TCG_Yavuz_(F_240))\n- [Yavuz-class frigate – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yavuz-class_frigate)\n- [Navypedia: Yavuz](https://navypedia.org/ships/turkey/tu_es_yavuz.htm)\n- [Seaforces: Yavuz class](https://www.seaforces.org/marint/Turkish-Navy/Frigates/Yavuz-class.htm)\n- [korabley.net](https://korabley.net/publ/819.html)",
